/ActualText (Housing rents account for half of core CPI inflation over the past yearStrength in October was led by recreational services, non-airfare transportation services, and household furnishings and supplies.We think the seasonally-adjusted core CPI increase for October was boosted around 0.05pp by distortions that result from the use of pandemic-era data to estimate the seasonal factors. These distortions even out across the year but lead to stronger increases in January, February, April, and October while pushing down changes in May and June.)
